{"version":1,"content":"<p>觀塘翠屏北邨翠楣樓發生刑事毀壞案件。</p><p>今早（17日）8時許，警方接獲上址職員報案，指發現上址一個共用廚房的5個玻璃窗被毀壞，並於大門發現糞便污漬。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T08:39:02.057533+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":73,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T08:17:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T08:37:34.291859+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T08:37:34.291859+00:00","content_hash":"0827101e69b5ab878a681f2826e8302d3eec357e1685549f81276c4330815421","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}